# Before you\
_build anything._

{.lede}
The [build guide](/guide) walks a working board through every step. These sheets cover the model underneath it: how you declare and lay out a document, and how you bring its channels online.

{.lede}
Building a screen users can assemble for themselves? That optional layer now has its own section: [the component model](/component-model).
