## Foundations

{.fh-scope .annot}
Core · every watershed app

3 sheets. Read in order — each one leans on the last.

{data-component="concept-aside"}
:::
Once a channel exists, [the field atlas](/structures) covers what it does when two clients touch it at once, and [runtime](/runtime) covers what happens while it's live: optimistic edits, reconnect, and the rest. Ready to see it running? Start [the survey procedure](/guide) at step one.
